    <div>
      <p begin="00:04.730" end="00:07.720" ttm:agent="v1">Shenrxn</p>
      <p begin="00:07.720" end="00:09.870" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="00:09.870" end="00:11.370" ttm:agent="v1">Nathan</p>
      <p begin="00:10.800" end="00:12.300" ttm:agent="v1">She don't lie</p>
      <p begin="00:12.070" end="00:13.980" ttm:agent="v1">I just wanna love you for one night, ayy</p>
      <p begin="00:13.980" end="00:16.910" ttm:agent="v1">We can watch a movie and we can get some fries, ayy</p>
      <p begin="00:16.910" end="00:19.870" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Come and vibe with me, baby, we can take a ride (take a ride)</p>
      <p begin="00:19.870" end="00:22.300" ttm:agent="v1">I just wanna love you, baby-baby, 'til we die</p>
      <p begin="00:22.300" end="00:23.800" ttm:agent="v1">She don't lie</p>
      <p begin="00:23.550" end="00:25.340" ttm:agent="v1">I just wanna love you for one night, ayy</p>
      <p begin="00:25.340" end="00:28.250" ttm:agent="v1">We can watch a movie and we can get some fries, ayy</p>
      <p begin="00:28.250" end="00:31.170" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Come and vibe with me, baby, we can take a ride (take a ride)</p>
      <p begin="00:31.170" end="00:34.370" ttm:agent="v1">I just wanna love you, baby-baby, 'til we die</p>
      <p begin="00:34.370" end="00:35.870" ttm:agent="v1">Hold up</p>
      <p begin="00:35.040" end="00:36.870" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Hold up, wait, wait, wait, wait (hah)</p>
      <p begin="00:36.870" end="00:39.870" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I can't deal with none of these hoes, they wanna link (wanna link)</p>
      <p begin="00:39.870" end="00:42.480" ttm:agent="v1">They think that I'm Sonic the way I want a ring</p>
      <p begin="00:42.480" end="00:45.930" ttm:agent="v1">But girl, I ain't no simp, yeah, shawty, I'm a king</p>
      <p begin="00:45.930" end="00:47.430" ttm:agent="v1">Hold up</p>
      <p begin="00:46.630" end="00:48.280" ttm:agent="v1">Hold up, wait, wait, wait, wait</p>
      <p begin="00:48.280" end="00:51.360" ttm:agent="v1">I can't deal with none of these hoes, they wanna link</p>
      <p begin="00:51.360" end="00:53.920" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">They think that I'm Sonic the way I want a ring (nah, nah)</p>
      <p begin="00:53.920" end="00:56.570" ttm:agent="v1">But girl, I ain't no simp, yeah, shawty, I'm a king</p>
      <p begin="00:56.570" end="00:58.070" ttm:agent="v1">Okay, I pull up in that Wraith</p>
      <p begin="00:57.920" end="01:00.460" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Diamonds on my neck and they look like lemonade (lemonade)</p>
      <p begin="01:00.460" end="01:03.400" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I stay steady flexin', I ain't never ever change (nah)</p>
      <p begin="01:03.400" end="01:06.070" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Baby showin' love now, but now I know it's all fake (fake)</p>
      <p begin="01:06.070" end="01:09.040" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Shoutout all my day ones, y'all the reason that I'm stay (stay)</p>
      <p begin="01:09.040" end="01:10.540" ttm:agent="v1">Shawty said she love me</p>
      <p begin="01:10.360" end="01:12.060" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I told that girl, &quot;Give me face&quot; (give me face)</p>
      <p begin="01:12.060" end="01:13.560" ttm:agent="v1">These hoes, they be textin'</p>
      <p begin="01:13.110" end="01:14.890" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">But they want me for the fame (for the fame)</p>
      <p begin="01:14.890" end="01:17.730" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Thinkin' they can get my heart, but it's locked in a safe (in a safe)</p>
      <p begin="01:17.730" end="01:19.420" ttm:agent="v1">I don't care about no love, I care 'bout gettin' paid</p>
      <p begin="01:19.420" end="01:20.920" ttm:agent="v1">She don't lie</p>
      <p begin="01:20.570" end="01:22.720" ttm:agent="v1">I just wanna love you for one night, ayy</p>
      <p begin="01:22.720" end="01:25.630" ttm:agent="v1">We can watch a movie and we can get some fries, ayy</p>
      <p begin="01:25.630" end="01:28.640" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Come and vibe with me, baby, we can take a ride (take a ride)</p>
      <p begin="01:28.640" end="01:30.930" ttm:agent="v1">I just wanna love you, baby-baby, 'til we die</p>
      <p begin="01:30.930" end="01:32.430" ttm:agent="v1">She don't lie</p>
