      <p begin="01:34.090" end="01:37.290" ttm:agent="v1">We can watch a movie and we can get some fries, ayy</p>
      <p begin="01:37.290" end="01:40.060" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Come and vibe with me, baby, we can take ride (take a ride)</p>
      <p begin="01:40.060" end="01:45.860" ttm:agent="v1">I just wanna love you, baby-baby, 'till we die</p>
